error[X0212]: a setter can't be more visible than its getter
 --> accessor-visibility.xn:8:23
  |
7 |   private function get size():int { return _size }
  |                        ---- `private`
8 |   public function set size(value:int):void { _size = value }         // a setter more visible than its getter
  |                       ^^^^ `public`
  |
  = note: a property can be read where it can be written: make the getter at least as visible

